  <h1 class="page-title">Managed Services Outsourcing</h1>
  <p class="hero-statement">A structured build-versus-outsource analysis for NOC, SOC, infrastructure operations, and platform management — so you know what to keep and what to hand off.</p>
  <a href="/contact.html" class="btn-primary">Discuss Your Sourcing Strategy</a>
